#: media_scout/arg_parser.py:108
msgid ""
"解析时间线、元数据表格等项目文件，从中提取包含的文件路径。支持干净的输出流或输出到文件。目前可以解析的类型包括：EDL表、FCP7 "
"经典XML、FCP XML文件或包、Davinci Resolve 媒体池元数据、纯文本路径列表等。"
msgstr ""
"Parse timeline, metadata table, and other project files to extract "
"contained file paths. Supports clean output stream or file output. "
"Supported types: EDL, FCP7 Classic XML, FCP XML, DaVinci Resolve media "
"pool, plain text paths, etc."

